00:00:20.509 --> 00:00:26.320
One from Portland, hipster 69 who says Fox
is still doing infomercials during impeachment.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.449
They are literally selling pillows from Australia
during impeachment.

00:00:29.449 --> 00:00:35.190
Yeah, so last week when it was the house impeachment
managers presenting their case, Fox news ran

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:40.040
video of the impeachment proceedings, but
very often the sound would be muted and you

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:45.140
would either have bomb throwing ideologues
saying things over the impeachment hearings

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.850
or sometimes they would go to commercials
like my pillow.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:52.190
I later found out that the MyPillow guy, the
owner of the my pillow company, I guess is

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.250
a huge Trump supporter.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.250
I had no idea.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.250
Sorry.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.690
As I hit my microphone.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:02.670
Um, and uh, reports are that Fox is continuing
to do this to some degree, although they seem

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:10.110
to air a lot more of the Trump lawyers presentations
with audio than they did the house managers.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.479
Not a huge surprise.

00:01:11.479 --> 00:01:17.610
A nostalgic cyan says, uh, has anyone noticed
the large amount of Mike Bloomberg ads?

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:22.109
I swear to God, 75% of my YouTube videos have
a Bloomberg ad.

00:01:22.109 --> 00:01:24.640
This is seriously so annoying.

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:27.810
If I had a dollar for every time I heard Mike,
we'll get it done.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:30.770
I could lobby Congress for legalizing weed.

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:31.770
Yes.

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:37.549
And what we are seeing is that the Bloomberg
ads are running wall to wall on YouTube, particularly

00:01:37.549 --> 00:01:41.100
if you live in a, um, a super Tuesday state.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:45.499
Super Tuesday States are the States that vote
