00:01:46.499 --> 00:01:48.639
I'm getting Mike Bloomberg ads, not even on
political content.

00:01:48.639 --> 00:01:55.560
I'll watch like you know, a, a Japanese omakase
save video from someone visiting Tokyo and

00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:02.590
