00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:23.800
Uh, so yes, I, a lot of people are telling
me all I get on YouTube now are Michael Bloomberg

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:31.519
ads.

00:02:31.519 --> 00:02:59.019
We're just

00:02:59.019 --> 00:03:17.689
